# split_cell_ps: gaps-disasm C5, the 16x2048x7168 split sweep (gapfix-launch-combine.md).
# hardware-properties: the native-gpu calibration line of the local RTX 5080 (MAPAL_GPU_CALIB, or copy it to
# ~/.cache/mapal/gpu-calib). Key: the device query's physical facts (`DeviceQuery::calib_key`), never a name.
# Values: `calib.cu` / `calib2.cu` / CUPTI measurements, sources in profile.rs `RTX_5080` and in this directory
# (E1-rtx-5080.txt, B-bw-rtx-5080.tsv, B-lds-rtx-5080.txt; gsync: kernel-merging.md Calls; copy:
# hardware-properties.md; row_iter_ns, coop_first_ns: long-rows.md; coop_body_cycles: calib.cu body, review-fixes.md §5 — cycles at this line's clock_khz); fly_bytes_per_sm: calib.cu bw `fly`, B-bw-rtx-5080.tsv (gemv-stream.md); bar_ns: calib.cu bar at 256 threads (flash-attention.md); tma_copy_ns: tma_calib.cu, box copies at ring depth >= 2 (hopper.md); lds_bcast_pm: calib.cu lds bcast, `col` at g = 8 (attention-chains.md); mma_tf32_per_clk / mma_half_per_clk: calib.cu matrix (f32-tensor-cores.md); l2_keep_bytes: l2keep.cu, a cyclic stream at 1.025x the L2 re-read at the L2/DRAM midpoint (integration.md). clock_khz is the measured clock under load (the query reports the boost clock).; sqrt/sin/cos_approx_*_e12, math_specials: calib.cu math (math.md, ADR-0046 D8)
# place.*: ADR-0050 placement probes (benches/local/place_calib.sh, one run on this RTX 5080, 2026-11-27; cost-model.md): start timing, the L2 keep for a rotated and a strided pattern and the sweep's next point (each keep's resolution), the hit-against-distance curve (x:y per mille), the loaded L2 latency, efficiency points (op:chains:groups x1000:per mille), dependent latencies (op:clocks x10), the sustained SM clock, the barrier cycles (calib.cu bar), and place.prim: the cost model's primitives (name:rate:lo:hi:latency:lo:hi:conc:lo:hi, milli-units of each probe's units; place_calib.cu prim). The scratchpad rows ld.shared.4 / ld.shared.16 / ldmatrix.x4: the pure pointer-chase rerun (review-fix 2026-11-27, same box; the first run's chain branched on its kind and moved its address by an IMAD, 68-69 clocks).
